-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("es",373,{
[11905]="70008B8E\n1\tHabla con Elladan\telladan está en Thorenhad, su campamento entre las Gargantas del Bruinen, al oeste de Rivendel. El señor Elrond te ha pedido que lleves noticias sobre los Corcur, que ahora viven en Helegrod bajo el poder de Angmar, a su hijo Elladan, quien ha luchado contra ellos durante mucho tiempo.\n",
[11906]="7002F993\n1\tEncuentra y entra en la guarida de los Osos de Púas\tLa guarida de los Osos de Púas está oculta en los valles de las colinas al este de Redilaldea, más allá del bosque. Inhere cree que las matronas de los Osos de Púas habitan en una cueva y te ha pedido que encuentres esta guarida en el valle.\n2\tDerrota a las matronas de los Osos de Púas (total: 3)\tLas matronas de los Osos de Púas están ocultas en la guarida al este de Redilaldea, más allá de la cortina de árboles. Inhere está convencido de que los Osos de Púas no cederán hasta que sus matronas poseídas sean derrotadas.\n3\tRegresa con Sahard para informarle sobre las matronas de los Osos de Púas\tSahard se encuentra en su granja, justo al este del Salón del Hidromiel de Redilaldea. Sahard espera en su granja el resultado de tus esfuerzos contra la horda de Osos de Púas.\n4\tHabla con Nothwulf en Redilaldea\tNothwulf se encuentra dentro del Salón del Hidromiel de Redilaldea. Nothwulf estará deseoso de escuchar las noticias sobre la derrota de la amenaza de los Osos de Púas.\n",
[11907]="700097D7\n1\tPurifica la estatua corrompida de Elendil en Tyl Ruinen\tLa estatua corrupta de Elendil está en una de las islas de Tyl Ruinen, al sur. Lithuifin te ha dado un brebaje para limpiar una de las estatuas de Elendil en Tyl Ruinen.\n",
[11908]="70066B20\n1\tDefeat Corsairs at Bel Tâkhmar (total: 10)\tSadrech has asked you to defeat Corsairs at Bel Tâkhmar. The encampment can be found north-east of her camp.\n2\tTalk to Sadrech at her camp\tYou have defeated enough Corsairs. You should let Sadrech know at her camp.\n",
[11909]="7006681B\n1\tDescubre Tathrendalf\tCorsairs linger in Tathrendalf.\n2\tDefeat Corsairs in Tathrendalf (total: 10)\tCorsairs linger in Tathrendalf. Defeat Corsairs.\n3\tCompletado\tYou have defeated many Corsairs in Tathrendalf.\n",
[11910]="700587A5\n1\tDefeat Brágha Fellwinder\030Defeat Natmoz\030Defeat the Angmarim overseers\tBrágha Fellwinder has gone to the tower of Caivád Sâr, in central Elderslade. You should defeat Brágha Fellwinder before she can pass on the knowledge of the crystals and the corruption her spells bring.\n2\tTalk to Borghild\tBorghild is in the Angmarim tower of Caivád Sâr in central Elderslade. Talk to Borghild.\n",
[11911]="7002CC3E\n1\tHabla con Doron\tDoron está entre sus hombres en el Campo de Celebrant. Doron desea contarte la historia de la maldición de los Perjurados.\n2\tHabla con Doron\tDoron está entre sus hombres en el Campo de Celebrant. Debes hablar con Doron acerca del relato que te ha contado.\n",
[11912]="700687AF\n1\tRemove disgusting harbour-filth from the waters of the Sail-haven (total: 12)\030Remove Heirsworn traitors from the waters of the Sail-haven (total: 6)\tDisgusting harbour-filth and the bodies of Heirsworn traitors can be found in the waters of the Sail-haven. Eshmun has asked you to help cleanse the waters of the Sail-haven by clearing it of filth and the bodies of Heirsworn traitors.\n2\tTalk to Eshmun at the Harbour-warden's Tower\tEshmun, Captain of the Haven, can be found at the Harbour-warden's Tower in the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl. You have done a great deal to cleanse the waters of the Sail-haven. You should return to Eshmun.\n",
[11913]="70044280\n1\tEnter the Dome of the Sun, where the Council of Gondor holds its meetings\tThe Council of Gondor meets inside the Dome of the Sun on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith. Othnar has invited you to enter the Dome of the Sun and lend your assistance to Arodor, chief scribe of the Council.\n2\tTalk to Arodor in the Dome of the Sun\tArodor is in the Dome of the Sun, writing resolutions recently decided by the Council of Gondor.\n3\tGather the scattered papers in the Dome of the Sun (total: 8)\tThe Dome of the Sun is filled with the scattered notes of the recent meeting of the Council. Arodor asked if you would gather up the scattered papers within the Dome of the Sun.\n4\tBring scattered papers to Arodor in the Dome of the Sun\tArodor is in the Dome of the Sun. You have gathered up the scattered papers that remained behind after the meeting of the Council of Gondor, and should bring them to Arodor.\n5\tWait for Arodor to finish writing the Council Resolutions\tArodor is in the Dome of the Sun, writing out the resolutions of the Council.\n6\tTalk to Arodor in the Dome of the Sun\tArodor is in the Dome of the Sun.\n7\tDeliver the resolution to Torchún in the south-east section of the Sixth Circle\030Deliver the resolution to Echadon in the south section of the Second Circle\030Deliver the resolution to Celephir in the Citadel\030Deliver the resolution to Mirudil in the south-east section of the Fifth Circle\tYou have agreed to deliver resolutions of the Council to several leaders of the city throughout Minas Tirith: Torchún, the Warden of the Houses of Healing. Echadon, the Captain of the Garrison. Celephir, the Warden of the Coffers. Mirudil, the Warden of the Stores.\n8\tTalk to Parthadan, Warden of the Green, in the south-east section of the Sixth Circle\tParthadan, the Warden of the Green, can be found in the Sixth Circle of the city. Echadon asked you to find Parthadan once you finished delivering the Council resolutions throughout the city.\n9\tBring the grim report to Thalhír in the north-east section of the Second Circle\tThalhír, the Warden of Laws, can be found in the Second Circle of the city. Parthadan gave you a grim report of the situation in the Pelennor to show to Thalhír.\n10\tBring the grim report to Arodor in the Dome of the Sun\tArodor is in the Dome of the Sun, on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith. Thalhír asked you to deliver Parthadan's grim report to Arodor for filing.\n",
[11914]="70038034\n1\tHabla con Herubrand\tHerubrand is in the cellar of the farmhouse near the farm fields of Woodhurst. Herubrand is gathering his advisors for a council meeting, at which you should be present.\n2\tHabla con Herubrand\tHerubrand is in the cellar of the farmhouse. The council meeting has ended, and Herubrand wishes to speak with you.\n",
[11915]="700374A5\n1\tTalk to Baldmund\030Talk to Grimmar\030Talk to Dudsig\030Talk to Thane Ordlac\030Deliver Reeve Fríthild's letter to Alfbert\tOrdlac and Grimmar are in the Mead Hall of Stoke. Baldmund is at the inn in Stoke. Dudsig is at the Oserley encampment outside the north-east gate of Stoke. Alfbert stands outside Reeve Fríthild's house. Fríthild has asked you to summon the leaders of Stoke to council and deliver a letter to Alfbert at her house.\n2\tTalk to Reeve Fríthild to join the Council of Stoke\tReeve Fríthild is in the Mead Hall of Stoke. You should return to Reeve Fríthild and let her know that all is ready for the council.\n3\tTalk to Reeve Fríthild\tReeve Fríthild is in the Mead Hall of Stoke. You should speak with Reeve Fríthild regarding the course she has chosen.\n",
[11916]="7000B402\n1\tHabla con Annábla\tHabla con Annábla de Gath Forthnír.\n",
[11917]="70022A76\n1\tBusca a Walt Trigal\030Busca a Bill Lanzaheno\030Busca a Thornton Bosquedal\tLos peones de la granja de Cal Sprigley se dirigieron hacia el este tras unos bandidos Montebruno que atacaron. Debes buscar a los peones desaparecidos y traerlos de vuelta sanos y salvos a la granja para que Wil y Cal puedan aliviar sus temores.\n2\tRegresa con Wil Trigal con las trágicas noticias\tWil Trigal está en la granja de Cal Sprigley, al sur de Archet, aguardando noticias de sus compañeros de trabajo y de su padre. Debes dar a Wil la noticia de que su padre y los otros peones fueron asesinados en su valiente persecución de los Montebruno.\n",
[11918]="7004C034\n1\tDerrota a las gemelas morroval\030Derrota a Dulgabêth el Roto\030Desbarata los planes de Lhaereth la Mancillada\tDesbarata los planes de Lhaereth para distribuir la Gran Peste.\n",
[11919]="7004C033\n1\tDerrota a los gemelos morroval\030Derrota a Dulgabêth el Quebrado\030Frustra los planes de Lhaereth la Mancillada\tFrustra los planes de Lhaereth y evita la liberación de la Gran Peste\n",
[11920]="700559A2\n1\tDefeat Kargríp\tKargríp can be found at Lírband upon the Circle of Madness. You should defeat Kargríp.\n2\tDefeat Kargríp\tKargríp can be found at Lírband upon the Circle of Madness. You should defeat Kargríp.\n3\tCompletado\tDefeated Kargríp.\n",
[11921]="7000BFC7\n1\tDerrota a Barz\030Derrota a Zurm\tBarz y Zurm están en Bornabar, dentro del sello derrumbado bajo el campamento de Iorelen. Jónsi te ha pedido que entres en las minas de los Orcos y derrotes a los supervisores gorthorogs, Barz y Zurm.\n2\tHabla con Jónsi\tJónsi se encuentra en el campamento de Iorelen. Debes regresar a Jónsi y contarle tu victoria contra Barz y Zurm.\n",
[11922]="70015E0B\n1\tDerrota a los crebain (total: 14)\tLos crebain se pueden encontrar al noreste de Echad Dúnann en la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo. Authlanc te ha pedido que derrotes a los Crebain en la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo.\n2\tHabla con Authlanc en Echad Dúnann\tAuthlanc se encuentra en Echad Dúnann, al sureste de la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo. Debes regresar con Authlanc y contarle sobre tu éxito.\n",
[11923]="7000B956\n1\tSigue buscando indicios de la criatura\tPuede haber señales del paso de la criatura en la orilla oriental. Deberías seguir buscando indicios de la criatura.\n2\tSigue buscando indicios de la criatura\tPuede haber señales del paso de la criatura en la orilla oriental. Deberías seguir buscando indicios de la criatura.\n3\tRegistra la cabaña en la orilla occidental en busca de señales de la criatura\tLa cabaña está en la orilla occidental del río. Has encontrado huesos de pescado roídos. La criatura debe de estar cerca, así que quizá haya entrado en la cabaña en la orilla occidental.\n4\tAdvierte a los habitantes de la cabaña del peligro cercano\tLa cabaña está en la orilla occidental del río. Deberías advertir a los habitantes de la cabaña del peligro cercano.\n",
[11924]="7002F35C\n1\tDerrota a las arañas en el Bosque Rastrero (total: 10)\tSe pueden encontrar arañas en el Bosque Rastrero. Waldeg te ha pedido que elimines varias arañas dentro del Bosque Rastrero.\n2\tHabla con Waldeg\tWaldeg está en Río Nevado. A Waldeg le agradará saber que ahora pocas arañas se arrastran por los túneles del Bosque Rastrero.\n",
[11925]="7002FC38\n1\tLibera a los Rohirrim en el Bosque Rastrero (total: 2)\tSe pueden encontrar Rohirrim atrapados dentro de capullos en el Bosque Rastrero. Waldeg te pidió que te aventuraras en el Bosque Rastrero y vieras si podías rescatar a algún Rohirrim atrapado.\n2\tHabla con Waldeg\tWaldeg está en Río Nevado. Waldeg se alegrará de saber que has rescatado a varios Rohirrim del Bosque Rastrero.\n",
[11926]="700662A8\n1\tFind Elladan somewhere in Tûm Rost\030Find Elrohir somewhere in Tûm Rost\tElladan and Elrohir went in search of Corsairs near Iáphel, intending to find any of the raiders who might have hidden after the attack.\n2\tTalk to Elladan in Ost Arndír\tElladan and Elrohir will have returned to Ost Arndír by the time you get there.\n3\tTalk to Elrohir in Ost Arndír\tElrohir is at Ost Arndír, waiting to speak to you.\n",
[11927]="700662B4\n1\tFind Gangur Farwend at Zarsatrâd, to the south of Furukzahar\tKutúkh told you that Gangur Farwend mentioned stopping at the outpost of Zarsatrâd to the south before continuing his journey.\n2\tTalk to Gangur Farwend in Zarsatrâd\tGangur Farwend is at the outpost of Zarsatrâd, south of Furukzahar.\n3\tDefeat foes of the dwarves near the outpost of Zarsatrâd (total: 6)\tThe dwarves at Zarsatrâd agreed to tell Gangur Farwend something about the strange gemstone he saw at Furukzahar if he aided them by defeating beasts near the outpost, and you agreed to help.\n4\tTalk to Gangur Farwend in Zarsatrâd\tGangur Farwend is at the outpost of Zarsatrâd, south of Furukzahar.\n5\tFind Gangur Farwend somewhere to the south-east of Zarsatrâd\tGangur Farwend stormed from Zarsatrâd after being embarrassed by the dwarves there. It looked to you as if he was heading in the direction of Erynos, but he likely wishes to stay away from people.\n6\tTalk to Gangur Farwend north of Erynos, in King's Gondor East\tGangur Farwend is south-east of Zarsatrâd and north of Erynos, in King's Gondor East.\n",
[11928]="700662A9\n1\tFind Leafshade's friend Gwallang the Limlinn\tLeafshade thinks an old sailor might have sailed away with his friend Gwallang, a songbird of the Limlinn species. If you could find him, Leafshade's whistle will apparently remind the bird from where he came.\n2\tTalk to Sirgon in his room of keepsakes about the caged songbird\tSirgon is in his manor's room of keepsakes.\n3\tStand near the caged songbird and blow the whistle given to you by Leafshade\tThe caged songbird at the far end of Sirgon's room of keepsakes may be Gwallang.\n4\tOpen the cage and free the songbird in Sirgon's room of keepsakes\tThe caged songbird certainly appeared to recognize the whistle. Sirgon has given you permission to open the cage and free the bird.\n5\tTalk to Leafshade in Tumbamálë\tLeafshade the Ent is in Tumbamálë, in south-western Anfalas.\n6\tTalk to Gwallang the Limlinn in Tumbamálë\tGwallang is in Tumbamálë, and apparently wants to tell you something.\n7\tTalk to Leafshade in Tumbamálë\tLeafshade is in Tumbamálë.\n",
[11929]="70066279\n1\tRetrieve Nauriel's sword from the armoury in Ost Arndír\030Retrieve Nauriel's shield from the armoury in Ost Arndír\tNauriel's sword and shield have been made ready for the voyage, and can be found on the lowest level of Ost Arndír.\n2\tTalk to Carandolion on the lowest level of Ost Arndír\tNauriel's husband Carandolion is on the lowest level of Ost Arndír.\n3\tBring her sword and shield to Nauriel in Ost Arndír\tNauriel is in the main hall, on the upper level of Ost Arndír.\n",
[11930]="7006627F\n1\tLook for Sigileth somewhere on the road to the Dark Door, north of Morlad in King's Gondor West\tIf you really expect Sigileth to pass through the Paths of the Dead, you should look for her on the road to the Dark Door, north of Morlad in the Blackroot Vale, in King's Gondor West.\n2\tTalk to Rovalang by the road to the Dark Door in the Blackroot Vale, in King's Gondor West\tThe Swan-knight Rovalang stands by the road to the Dark Door, in King's Gondor West.\n3\tDefeat foes in the Blackroot Vale, King's Gondor West (total: 8)\tThe Swan-knight Rovalang asked for your help making safe the Blackroot Vale in King's Gondor West.\n4\tTalk to Rovalang by the road to the Dark Door in the Blackroot Vale, in King's Gondor West\tThe Swan-knight Rovalang stands by the road to the Dark Door, in King's Gondor West.\n5\tWait for the newcomer to arrive\tSomeone approaches from the direction of the Dark Door.\n6\tTalk to Sigileth on the road to the Dark Door in the Blackroot Vale, in King's Gondor West\tSigileth has come to the Blackroot Vale, in King's Gondor West, in search of her brother Corudan.\n7\tTalk to Rovalang by the road to the Dark Door in the Blackroot Vale, in King's Gondor West\tThe Swan-knight Rovalang stands by the road to the Dark Door, in King's Gondor West.\n",
[11931]="7006627A\n1\tTalk to Elestren in Melgobas\tElestren has a home in Melgobas and may know how to make a sea-sickness remedy for Gimli.\n2\tCollect Langstrand wild-flowers (total: 6)\030Collect beast parts from crawlers, crabs, or oxen near Melgobas (total: 4)\tLangstrand wild-flowers can be found north of Melgobas, in the grass alongside the road. Crawlers, oxen, and crabs can be found outside the village.\n3\tBring the flowers and assorted beast parts to Elestren in Melgobas\tElestren has a home in Melgobas and is waiting for you to return to her with the flowers and beast parts she requested.\n4\tTalk to Legolas in Melgobas\tLegolas is outside the home of Elestren in Melgobas.\n",
[11932]="70066286\n1\tFind Jajax at Abadec's Watch, south-east of Dol Amroth, in King's Gondor West\tPrince Imrahil's scouts reported seeing Jajax near Abadec's Watch to the south-east of Dol Amroth, in King's Gondor West.\n2\tTalk to Jajax outside Abadec's Watch\tJajax stands outside Abadec's Watch, in King's Gondor West.\n3\tDefeat Corsairs inside Abadec's Watch (total: 8)\tYour rescue of Daxamat from Abadec's Watch will require you to defeat the Corsairs camped inside.\n4\tFree Daxamat inside Abadec's Watch\tDaxamat is being held prisoner inside Abadec's Watch, in King's Gondor West.\n5\tWait for Daxamat to escape\tYou have freed Daxamat from his bonds.\n6\tTalk to Jajax outside Abadec's Watch, in King's Gondor West\tJajax stands outside Abadec's Watch, in King's Gondor West.\n7\tTalk to Daxamat outside Abadec's Watch, in King's Gondor West\tDaxamat stands outside Abadec's Watch, in King's Gondor West.\n8\tTalk to Jajax outside Abadec's Watch, in King's Gondor West\tJajax stands outside Abadec's Watch, in King's Gondor West.\n",
[11933]="700662B3\n1\tCollect Galengam's notices throughout Calembel, in King's Gondor West (total: 8)\tGalengam's notices can be found throughout Calembel, in King's Gondor West.\n2\tBurn Galengam's notices in the brazier located near the southern entrance of Calembel, in King's Gondor West\tThe brazier by the southern entrance to Calembel, in King's Gondor West, will be an effective way to dispose of Galengam's notices.\n3\tTalk to Bandron by the brazier in Calembel, in King's Gondor West\tBandron, standing nearby, has attracted your attention.\n4\tTalk to Galengam inside his shop in Calembel, in King's Gondor West\tGalengam is inside his shop in Calembel, in King's Gondor West.\n",
[11934]="7006627B\n1\tPick up Sirgon's trunk in the southern dining room\tSirgon already packed his trunk, and he wants you to carry it to him from the southern dining room.\n2\tTalk to Sirgon inside his room of keepsakes\tSirgon is inside his keepsake room in the northern part of his manor.\n3\tTalk to Faltharan in Sirgon's manor\030Talk to Celebros in Sirgon's manor\tCelebros and Faltharan are in Sirgon's manor, and will want to speak to you.\n4\tTalk to Sirgon inside his room of keepsakes\tSirgon is inside his keepsake room in the northern part of his manor.\n",
[11935]="700662B0\n1\tTalk to Rossaran north-east of Tadrent, in King's Gondor West\tThe Swan-knight Rossaran left Tadrent heading north-east.\n2\tCollect Belfalas wild-flowers from the camp of Makham Mijann (total: 6)\tWild-flowers grow in the camp of Makham Mijann, north of Tadrent, in King's Gondor West.\n3\tBring the Belfalas wild-flowers to Rossaran outside Makham Mijann, in King's Gondor West\tThe Swan-knight Rossaran is just outside the eastern entrance of Makham Mijann, in King's Gondor West.\n4\tTalk to Bruidis at Tadrent, in King's Gondor West\tRossaran's wife Bruidis is at Tadrent, in King's Gondor West, and she will have the final word on whether her husband joins the crew of the Wave-hunter.\n5\tTalk to Rossaran at Tadrent, in King's Gondor West\tThe Swan-knight Rossaran is at Tadrent in King's Gondor West, preparing for the voyage.\n",
[11936]="70021EED\n1\tHabla con la anciana del río en la Arboleda Lóbrega.\tLa anciana de la que te ha hablado Tûm puede encontrarse a veces en las orillas del río que atraviesa la Arboleda Lóbrega. Tûm te ha sugerido buscar a la anciana que recorre el río de la Arboleda Lóbrega. Es posible que ella conozca algo sobre los Señores del Bosque.\n2\tRecoge los dientes de Cun Annûn (total: 10)\tLos Cun Annûn pueden encontrarse por toda la Arboleda Lóbrega. La Mujer del Río te ha ofrecido llevarte a lo largo del río si le entregas los dientes de los Cun Annûn que merodean por el bosque de la Arboleda Lóbrega.\n3\tLleva los dientes de Cun Annûn a la Mujer del Río en la Arboleda Lóbrega.\tLa Mujer del Río puede encontrarse a lo largo de las orillas del río, en la Arboleda Lóbrega. Debes volver con la Mujer del Río y entregarle los dientes de Cun Annûn que has recogido.\n",
})
